step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a single best model hypothesis – THETA, which is the trend champion and top RMSE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a robust trimmed mean over the most stable pool (pool3) to see if trimming improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","models":["ETS","THETA","rf","CWT_rf","DWT_rf","CWT_catboost"],"trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the smallest stable pool (pool1) to see if it improves on the current trimmed mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median over the moderately stable pool2 to see if it improves over mean and trimmed mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if the robust pool still benefits from averaging rather than trimming.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if including all models with trimming improves over the current best trimmed_mean pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a deterministic DTW barycenter (dba) on the robust pool4 to see if it outperforms the trimmed mean on the same pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple median over the robust pool4 to see if it beats the trimmed mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a median combination on the more diverse pool3 to see if it beats the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a deterministic DTW barycenter on the smallest robust pool (pool1) to see if fewer models give a cleaner average.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test DBA on pool3 to see if a different robust pool improves over current best.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on pool4 to see if it beats trimmed_mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ETS","THETA","rf","CWT_rf","DWT_rf","CWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

